{
  "name": "Distorted Distance",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A 60-ft-radius Sphere within 120 ft distorts space for each creature you choose: <strong>Dizzying Elongation</strong> - INT save or 2d10 Psychic damage and the Sphere is Difficult Terrain for it until the end of its turn; or <strong>Shortened Space</strong> - its Speed increases by 20 ft until the end of its next turn. Cast it on the creatures you want dizzied, then use the Shortened Space activity on others. While you concentrate, use the activities (no slot) when a creature enters the Sphere or ends its turn there, once per turn each.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
